---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<MainLayout title="Yoyo | Research / 研究">

<Navbar />

<section class="research-page">

<div class="header">
<h1>
研究 <span class="en">Research</span>
</h1>
<p>
探索人工智能与生物医学、机械工程的交叉领域。 <span class="en">Exploring the intersection of AI, Biomedical Science and Mechanical Engineering.</span>
</p>
</div>

<section class="card">
<h2>
研究项目 <span class="en">Research Projects</span>
</h2>

<a href="/projects/lung-cancer-lm-prediction" class="project-item">
<div class="project-icon">🧠</div>
<div class="project-info">
<h3>
基于人工智能的肺癌脑膜转移预测研究
<span class="en">AI-based Lung Cancer Leptomeningeal Metastasis Prediction</span>
</h3>
<p>
基于深度学习的 MRI 诊断与预测模型，国创赛金奖，国家级项目。
<span class="en">Deep learning MRI diagnosis and prediction model, National Innovation Competition Gold Award, National-level project.</span>
</p>
<div class="tags">
<span>MRI</span>
<span>Deep Learning</span>
<span>Transformer</span>
<span>Multimodal AI</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="project-arrow">→</div>
</a>

<a href="/projects/lstm-aero-engine-rul" class="project-item">
<div class="project-icon">✈️</div>
<div class="project-info">
<h3>
基于 LSTM 的航空发动机剩余寿命预测研究
<span class="en">LSTM-based Aero-engine Remaining Useful Life Prediction</span>
</h3>
<p>
第一主持人，国豪论坛学术汇报。
<span class="en">Lead Researcher, Guohao Forum Academic Presentation.</span>
</p>
<div class="tags">
<span>LSTM</span>
<span>Time Series</span>
<span>RUL Prediction</span>
<span>Aerospace</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="project-arrow">→</div>
</a>

<a href="/projects/gearbox-design" class="project-item">
<div class="project-icon">⚙️</div>
<div class="project-info">
<h3>
减速箱的设计
<span class="en">Gearbox Design</span>
</h3>
<p>
机械设计课程项目，包含设计计算说明书、总装爆炸图视频与二维工程图。
<span class="en">Mechanical design course project with calculation documentation, assembly explosion video and 2D drawings.</span>
</p>
<div class="tags">
<span>Mechanical Design</span>
<span>Gearbox</span>
<span>SolidWorks</span>
<span>Engineering Drawing</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="project-arrow">→</div>
</a>

</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
研究兴趣 <span class="en">Research Interests</span>
</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="interest-card">
<h3>🧠 医学影像AI <span class="en">Medical Imaging AI</span></h3>
<p>MRI分析、疾病预测与计算机视觉。 <span class="en">MRI analysis, disease prediction and computer vision.</span></p>
</div>
<div class="interest-card">
<h3>🤖 深度学习 <span class="en">Deep Learning</span></h3>
<p>时序模型、Transformer 与多模态学习。 <span class="en">Time series, Transformer and multimodal learning.</span></p>
</div>
<div class="interest-card">
<h3>🔬 智能机械 <span class="en">Intelligent Mechanics</span></h3>
<p>具身智能、机器人系统与机械设计。 <span class="en">Embodied AI, robotic systems and mechanical design.</span></p>
</div>
<div class="interest-card">
<h3>🏥 智能医疗 <span class="en">Intelligent Healthcare</span></h3>
<p>构建辅助临床决策的AI系统。 <span class="en">Building AI systems to assist clinical decisions.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</section>

</MainLayout>

<style>
.research-page{
padding:140px 10% 100px;
background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF9F5 0%, #F0F5FF 100%);
}

.header{
text-align:center;
margin-bottom:70px;
}
.header h1{
font-size:52px;
margin-bottom:15px;
}
.header p{
font-size:20px;
color:#777;
}

.card{
margin-bottom:35px;
padding:40px;
border-radius:35px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}
.card h2{
font-size:30px;
margin-bottom:25px;
}

.project-item{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:25px;
padding:28px 30px;
margin-bottom:18px;
border-radius:25px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
text-decoration:none;
color:#444;
transition:.3s;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
}
.project-item:last-child{
margin-bottom:0;
}
.project-item:hover{
transform:translateY(-5px);
box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(171,158,196,0.15);
border-color:rgba(171,158,196,0.3);
}

.project-icon{
font-size:45px;
width:80px;
height:80px;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
border-radius:20px;
background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE5F0, #E4EEFF);
flex-shrink:0;
}

.project-info{
flex:1;
min-width:0;
}
.project-info h3{
font-size:22px;
margin:0 0 8px;
}
.project-info p{
font-size:15px;
color:#666;
margin:0 0 12px;
line-height:1.6;
}
.project-info .tags{
display:flex;
gap:10px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.project-info .tags span{
padding:5px 15px;
background:#FFE4F0;
border-radius:20px;
font-size:13px;
color:#888;
}

.project-arrow{
font-size:28px;
color:#ab9ec4;
opacity:0;
transform:translateX(-10px);
transition:.3s;
flex-shrink:0;
}
.project-item:hover .project-arrow{
opacity:1;
transform:translateX(0);
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
gap:20px;
}

.interest-card{
padding:25px;
border-radius:25px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
transition:.3s;
}
.interest-card:hover{
transform:translateY(-8px);
box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}
.interest-card h3{
font-size:20px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}
.interest-card p{
font-size:15px;
color:#666;
line-height:1.6;
}

@media(max-width:900px){
.project-item{
flex-direction:column;
align-items:flex-start;
}
.project-arrow{
display:none;
}
.grid{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}
.header h1{font-size:36px;}
.card{padding:30px 25px;}
.card h2{font-size:24px;}
}
</style>
